\subsection{Task 2: Sentence Simplification}

The second task is a sentence simplification task. The input is a sentence and the output is a simplified version of the sentence. The simplified version should be grammatically correct and should preserve the meaning of the original sentence.

\subsection{Task 3: Text Summarization}

The third task is a text summarization task. The input is a text and the output is a summary of the text. The summary should be grammatically correct and should preserve the meaning of the original text.
